# Allowlist: ignore everything, then re-include ONLY what ships in the .vsix.
**

# Extension runtime
!package.json
!dist/extension.js
!dist/welcome.js
!dist/welcome.css
!dist/sidebar.js
!dist/sidebar.css
!media/**

# Marketplace metadata
!README.md
!LICENSE.md
!CHANGELOG.md

# Bundled agent plugins: built by esbuild from src/plugins/ (entry points bundled, assets/ copied)
# into dist/plugins — these are the distributed artifacts the installers stage/register.
!dist/plugins/**
